    "reason": "The alternating region left of the origin is a COUNTDOWN: if its depth is exactly `L + 1` at time `t` then it is exactly `L` at time `t + 1` -- it cannot grow, cannot hold, and cannot shrink by two. The `≥` half is rule30_alternating_step; the sharp half is one line, because the cell that would extend the region is the negation of the first cell that broke the pattern, and negating a broken pattern breaks it again. Why this is the node the tier exists to reach: with column_black_run_of_alternating and column_alternating_of_black_run it says the centre column's black runs cannot be built up gradually. Each black run is CREATED in a single step, and it can only be created at a time when the centre cell is white -- because that is the only time the countdown is not already running. So the whole black side of the centre column is decided at its white times, which is exactly where obstruction 9 says the P1 residual lives; the two arrive at the same seam from opposite directions.",
